{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 61,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.09295654296875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "was still an effective bronchodilator and, in one study, the bronchodilatory effect of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        279.5028991699219,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "oral salbutamol lasted longer than inhaled salbutamol.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.071533203125,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "One study randomized 780 children with WHO-defined non-severe or severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.07257080078125,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia and wheeze to standard dosages of either oral (390 children) or inhaled (390",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.0529479980469,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "children) salbutamol. Children were sent home on antibiotics and a bronchodilator.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.09283447265625,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Sixty-six children in the oral group and 62 children in the inhaled group failed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0428466796875,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "treatment by day 5, but this difference did not reach statistical significance (RR 0.94,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        142.5605010986328,
        150.52207946777344,
        239.42050170898438,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.13",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        246.76739501953125,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "95% CI 0.68 to 1.29) ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        175.2606964111328,
        163.96286010742188,
        187.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "6.5.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        203.04539489746094
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.91539001464844,
        399.13287353515625,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Oral salbutamol is inexpensive (taking into account the cost of metered-dose inhalers",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.91539001464844,
        399.1128845214844,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "for inhaled salbutamol), easy to store, easy to deliver, and therefore more likely to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.91539001464844,
        142.2729034423828,
        243.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "promote compliance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        263.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        264.4192810058594,
        399.1927795410156,
        277.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "With delayed onset of action, a higher dose is required, and there is a greater",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.4192810058594,
        399.08282470703125,
        290.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of side effects. Oral salbutamol cannot be used as a ‘trial of bronchodilator’",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        290.4192810058594,
        399.0928039550781,
        303.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "(for which inhaled salbutamol should be used) as recommended by IMCI for children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.4192810058594,
        188.222900390625,
        316.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "with wheeze and fast-breathing.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        327.9378967285156,
        205.31298828125,
        339.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "6.5.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        343.5924987792969,
        399.12286376953125,
        357.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "Oral salbutamol is inexpensive, much easier to prescribe and deliver than inhaled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        356.5924987792969,
        399.1227722167969,
        370.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "salbutamol, and is likely to be more acceptable to parents and children. However, it",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        369.5924987792969,
        399.0928039550781,
        383.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "is an inferior mode of delivery. The emphasis should therefore be on making inhaled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        382.5924987792969,
        311.13287353515625,
        396.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "salbutamol and metered-dose inhalers more available globally.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.53570556640625,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.50970458984375,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "47",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}